### List active currency metadata
GET http://localhost:8000/currencing/currencies
Accept: application/json

### Read one currency by ISO code
GET http://localhost:8000/currencing/currencies/USD
Accept: application/json

### Read selector data
GET http://localhost:8000/currencing/currency-selector
Accept: application/json

### Normalize money amount
POST http://localhost:8000/currencing/money/normalize
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": "12.34",
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "consumerName": "Ordering",
  "roundingContext": "ordering"
}

### Read Currencing/Exchanging boundary
GET http://localhost:8000/currencing/conversion-boundary
Accept: application/json
